  "details": "To be quick, i would like an option to force hand tracking when VRChat loses focus, and to see the stream cameras local position, rotation, and FOV in tracking space.\n\nThe first part allows users to launch a desktop or VR game if permitted (i know oculus dash allows for this if the game is through the oculus store) and overlay our avatars into the game like with mixed reality. The second allows easy alignment of the stream camera with the MR camera.\n\nI know not every game would be compatible and vive / WMR users would need to find a workaround to launching two steamvr games, but i figured its worth a try posting.",
